## Context
UX-PROCESS.md step 3 ("After the run") says:
  erg log 0152 "Claude dry-run Path <A|B> -- N items: ..."
Ticket 0152 was closed and archived on 2026-05-30. Logging to a closed
ticket is semantically wrong and may fail.

The parallel doc SECURITY-PROCESS.md had the same issue with ticket 0151
and was fixed in PR #228 by dropping the step entirely (the run output
is the durable record, not a breadcrumb on a closed tracker).

## Actions
1. Remove or rewrite UX-PROCESS.md step 3 referencing erg log 0152.

